## 📚 Examples from Codebase

### DataAggregationService
```php
class DataAggregationService
{
    protected ?TransactionItemRepository $transactionRepository = null;
    protected ?WalletRepository $walletRepository = null;

    public function __construct()
    {
        // Lazy loading - không inject dependencies ở constructor
    }

    protected function getTransactionRepository(): TransactionItemRepository
    {
        if (!$this->transactionRepository instanceof TransactionItemRepository) {
            $this->transactionRepository = app()->make(TransactionItemRepository::class);
        }
        return $this->transactionRepository;
    }
}
```

